  "limitations": [
    "One signed-in account and one run. Feed content, cache state, server experiments and ads can change subsequent results.",
    "Packet phase windows and sequential counter snapshot spans differ. Counter deltas include boundary collection overhead and must use their own elapsed interval.",
    "Only exact socket tuple observations within three seconds support packet UID correlation. Ten-second background polling leaves gaps; screen-off has boundary snapshots only. Unknown traffic remains unknown.",
    "Primary-UID counters exclude traffic under separate isolated UIDs. Point-in-time isolated UID mappings are recorded only as presence flags and are not extended across the run.",
    "SNI identifies the visible name offered for TLS, not request paths, payload fields, telemetry purpose or successful server receipt. Existing connections and QUIC may reveal no service name.",
    "IP bytes include headers, acknowledgments and retransmissions. Any-interface capture can duplicate traffic. These totals differ from unique content bytes, physical radio bytes and Android accounting counters.",
    "Main-process CPU subtraction excludes processes that start and exit between boundaries or isolated processes without matching dumps. App Batterystats CPU can include mapped isolated-process accounting. Media timers do not classify sponsored content or prove audible playback.",
    "CPU, media timers and modeled battery statistics are activity measures. The emulator has synthetic battery state and supplies no physical charge, energy or phone battery-life measurement.",
    "The host had constrained available memory. Emulation and capture overhead affect timing and CPU behavior, so this is not a representative physical-phone performance benchmark.",
    "Screen-on background started in deep ACTIVE and light ACTIVE states. Screen-off started with both INACTIVE and ended with deep INACTIVE and light IDLE. The display was Asleep at both screen-off boundaries. Another app's long partial wake lock persisted, and deep Doze or sustained suspend was not established.",
    "Registered jobs are not executing jobs. Job timer increases do not establish the worker's business purpose. Missing named alarm entries do not prove that no alarm can occur.",
    "Public data omits raw UIDs, process IDs, socket endpoints, IP addresses, account details, private file paths, unrelated app hostnames and configurable SDK hostname prefixes."
  ]
